  with zero suppress entries. Add a suppress entry here ONLY for a specific CVE that has been
  reviewed and determined to be a false positive or genuinely not exploitable in this
  application's own usage of the flagged dependency; never as a way to silence a real,
  unaddressed finding. See https://jeremylong.github.io/DependencyCheck/general/suppression.html
  for the suppression-file schema.
-->
